reducer idea from NVlabs/SoL-Pi (https://github.com/NVlabs/SoL-Pi,
Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA Corporation & Affiliates, MIT License). No SoL-Pi
code is copied.

Additionally includes three commands merged and adapted from:

  ecc (Everything Claude Code) — https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC
  Copyright (c) Affaan Mustafa, MIT License (licenses/ecc-MIT.txt)

  - commands/ecc-build-fix.md   (verbatim from ecc build-fix)
  - commands/ecc-learn.md       (verbatim from ecc learn)
  - commands/ecc-skill-create.md(adapted: ecc's instinct / continuous-learning
